 Rachel Zegler, Taye Diggs, Norbert Leo Butz, More Join Rent Broadway Anniversary Concert
 The landmark Tony- and Pulitzer-winning Jonathan Larson musical is celebrating its 30th anniversary at Broadway's Richard Rodgers.
 October 19, 2026 
 By Logan Culwell-Block 
 Broadway's upcoming  Rent Broadway anniversary concert, set for October 26 at the Richard Rodgers Theatre, has added more stars to its roster, including more of the musical's original cast. Tickets for the special event celebrating the landmark 1996 Jonathan Larson musical are technically sold out, but a digital lottery for the evening's box seats is currently open through October 20 at 2 PM ET (enter at BroadwayDirect.com ).
 The event will also stream live, and available on demand after. The stream will be available through October 27 at 11 PM ET. Streaming tickets are at BroadwayCares.org .
 Taye Diggs , Timothy Britten Parker , and Byron Utley have joined the lineup of original Broadway  Rent stars who will be on hand to mark the rock musical's 30th anniversary, along with the previously announced   Idina Menzel , Adam Pascal , Anthony Rapp , Daphne Rubin-Vega , Wilson Jermaine Heredia , Fredi Walker-Browne, Yassmin Alers , Gilles Chiasson , Shelley Dickinson , David Driver , Darius de Haas, and Rodney Hicks .
 The evening will also feature  Rent  alumni and Broadway favorites. Newly announced attendees include:  Sharon Catherine Brown , Bryson Bruce , Haven Burton , Tony winner Norbert Leo Butz , Matt Caplan , Will Chase , Wilson Cruz , Coleman Cummings, Laura Dias, Tori DePrimo, Shaun Earl , Eden Espinosa , Rayla Garske, Ava Gaudet , Andrea Goss , Tamyra Gray , Christopher J. Hanke , Tony winner Neil Patrick Harris , Nicolette Hart , Marcus Paul James , Cody Jenkins, Justin Johnston , Owen Johnston II, Adam Kantor , Lencia Kebede , Tamika Lawrence , Telly Leung , Tracy McDowell , Michael McElroy , David Merino , Alan Mingo Jr., Manley Pope , James Schoppe, Andy Señor Jr., Aiyana Smash , Antonique Smith , Jacques C. Smith , Tracie Thoms , Deri’Andra Tucker, Lorraine Velez, Jay Wilkison , Schele Williams , and Rachel Zegler . 
 They will join the previously announced Natalie Venetia Belcon , Adam Chanler-Berat , Nicholas Christopher , Merle Dandridge , Trey Ellett , Jordan Fisher , Renée Elise Goldsberry , Jose Llana , John Eric Parker , Jai Rodriguez , Antonique Smith, Ephraim Sykes , and Aaron Tveit .
